<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Xeikon cut to hold.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Xeikon cut to hold.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Prudential Securities confirmed that it downgraded Xeikon NV to hold from buy.</p>
<p>-- Additional details not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Earlier today, Xeikon reported a first quarter pro forma loss of $0.14 per share versus a profit of $0.01 in the comparable year-ago period.</p>
<p>-- Shares fell 1-1/8 to 7-1/8.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
